{"id":"526d014f8a51723a","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-first-order-spec.md","title":"df-first-order-spec","display":"df-first-order-spec","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-first-order-spec","aliases":["16-df-first-order-spec","First-order specification"],"display":"df-first-order-spec","depends_on":["[[16-df-formula]]","[[16-df-set]]","[[16-df-function]]"],"source":"Definition 4.1.3, p.227 (PDF247); local closed-sentence presentation of axioms","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-first-order-spec"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-first-order-spec</span><span>First-order specification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-spec"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f205978a7c11015b\" href=\"?note=f205978a7c11015b\" title=\"16-df-function\">16-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.1.3, p.227 (PDF247); local closed-sentence presentation of axioms"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,F,P\">\\(S,F,P\\)</span> 为固定大小约定内的小集合，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P\\)</span> 为候选集合函数图，不预设其型属或全函数条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Function}_{16}\">\\(\\mathsf{Function}_{16}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f205978a7c11015b\" href=\"?note=f205978a7c11015b\" title=\"16-df-function\">16-df-function</a> 的图谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{*}\">\\(S^{*}\\)</span> (有限排序列表集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(S,F,P,\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P)\">\\(\\Sigma=(S,F,P,\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P)\\)</span> (候选签名)</li>\n<li>仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 成立的分支，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a> 的形式构造；该页签名分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F,a_P\">\\(a_F,a_P\\)</span> 分别取本页 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{*}\">\\(S^{*}\\)</span> 使用同一有限列表约定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSpec}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSpec}\\)</span> 的合法/非法输入分支在 Assertion 显式给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (候选公理集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSig},\\mathrm{FOSpec}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSig},\\mathrm{FOSpec}\\)</span> (谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}signature} \\vdash \\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(\\operatorname{ar}_F,F,S^{*}\\times S)\\land\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(\\operatorname{ar}_P,P,S^{*})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}signature} \\vdash \\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(\\operatorname{ar}_F,F,S^{*}\\times S)\\land\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(\\operatorname{ar}_P,P,S^{*})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}specification} \\vdash \\mathrm{FOSpec}(\\Sigma,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\begin{cases}T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma),\\\\\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}specification} \\vdash \\mathrm{FOSpec}(\\Sigma,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\begin{cases}T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma),\\\\\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本页采用一阶签名与闭公式公理集的呈现，不额外混入模型或满足关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a> 已构造的空自由变量公式集。</li>\n<li>原书 Definition4.1.3（印刷227/PDF247）允许带语境的序贯公理；这里的闭句呈现是其全一阶逻辑形式。有限语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(x_i:s_i)\">\\(\\Gamma=(x_i:s_i)\\)</span>、有限假设列表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 的序贯 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> 可编码为闭句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x_1:s_1\\cdots\\forall x_n:s_n((\\bigwedge\\Theta)\\Rightarrow\\varphi)\">\\(\\forall x_1:s_1\\cdots\\forall x_n:s_n((\\bigwedge\\Theta)\\Rightarrow\\varphi)\\)</span>，空合取取真。两个方向由全称引入/消去与蕴涵引入/消去给出，不需要各排序非空；不把本页称为原书规格数据的逐字重现，也不据此断言正则或coherent片段中的等价编码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"f205978a7c11015b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,F,P$ 为固定大小约定内的小集合，采用 [[16-df-set]]；$\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P$ 为候选集合函数图，不预设其型属或全函数条件。$\\mathsf{Function}_{16}$ 采用 [[16-df-function]] 的图谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"f205978a7c11015b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,F,P$ 为固定大小约定内的小集合，采用 [[16-df-set]]；$\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P$ 为候选集合函数图，不预设其型属或全函数条件。$\\mathsf{Function}_{16}$ 采用 [[16-df-function]] 的图谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"仅在 $\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma)$ 成立的分支，$\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)$ 采用 [[16-df-formula]] 的形式构造；该页签名分量 $a_F,a_P$ 分别取本页 $\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P$，$S^{*}$ 使用同一有限列表约定。$\\mathrm{FOSpec}$ 的合法/非法输入分支在 Assertion 显式给出。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本页采用一阶签名与闭公式公理集的呈现，不额外混入模型或满足关系。$\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)$ 是 [[16-df-formula]] 已构造的空自由变量公式集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,F,P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Function}_{16}","display":false},{"tex":"S^{*}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(S,F,P,\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"a_F,a_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P","display":false},{"tex":"S^{*}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOSpec}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOSig},\\mathrm{FOSpec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}signature} \\vdash \\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(\\operatorname{ar}_F,F,S^{*}\\times S)\\land\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(\\operatorname{ar}_P,P,S^{*})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}specification} \\vdash \\mathrm{FOSpec}(\\Sigma,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\begin{cases}T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)&\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma),\\\\\\bot&\\neg\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=(x_i:s_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x_1:s_1\\cdots\\forall x_n:s_n((\\bigwedge\\Theta)\\Rightarrow\\varphi)","display":false}],"bytes":2458,"backlinks":[{"id":"b349c4a4adf1aa47","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(S,F,\\operatorname{ar}_F)$、$\\Pi=(P,\\operatorname{ar}_P)$ 为候选记录。$S^*$、$\\mathrm{PredSig}$ 与合并记录 $\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}$ 以下文为定义；$\\mathrm{FOSig}$ 采用 [[16-df-first-order-spec]] 的五元签名。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-first-order-spec|df-first-order-spec]]"}],"outgoing":["24a3d0c12f4602b7","09b2ae01fb2d54e3","f205978a7c11015b"]}